## Acceptance criteria
- The `SmsAdapter` interface is defined and `DevOutboxAdapter` implements it.
- Check-in queues SMS rows for Parent 1 and Parent 2 (when different).
- The queue worker processes pending messages and updates status.
- Failed messages retry with backoff and can be permanently failed.
- Staff can list and retry failed messages via the API.
- Check-in succeeds even when SMS fails.
- `npm run typecheck` and `npm run test` pass.

## Required automated tests
- Parent 1 SMS queued.
- Parent 2 SMS queued when valid and different.
- Duplicate parent phone normalization (one SMS).
- Missing Parent 2 phone (one SMS).
- Failed SMS retry.
- Permanently failed status.
- Queue worker status transitions.

